From 5b5bdb8bef3bde1e4c69cb3f1cf4c4c6fa62c0db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael John <mj@tierone.software>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 16:09:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] src.custom: fix __progname declaration constness

'extern char const *__progname' conflicts with the non-const
declaration used by glibc and include/stdlib.h. Declare it non-const.
---
